{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "  ·  ⏎ 确认": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "  ·  ⏎ to confirm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · 已复制到剪贴板": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · Copied to clipboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · 配准 %.0f ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · Alignment %.0f ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ px · %lld 个标注": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ px · %lld annotations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已被其他应用占用（例如微信的截图快捷键）。\n请到菜单栏「快捷键…」换一个组合。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is already taken by another app (WeChat's screenshot shortcut, for example).\nPick a different combination from the menu bar: Shortcuts…."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（当前工具）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (current tool)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@，按 ⏎ 结束可保留已拼好的部分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Press ⏎ to finish and keep what has been stitched so far."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "7 天免费试用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a 7-day free trial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JPEG / HEIC 有损，可调质量": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JPEG and HEIC are lossy; quality is adjustable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee Pro · 免费版（最近截图保留 %lld 张）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee Pro · Free (keeps the last %lld captures)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee Pro · 已购买，谢谢": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee Pro · Purchased, thank you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee Pro · 正在确认…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee Pro · Checking…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee Pro · 试用中，还剩 %lld 天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee Pro · Trial, %lld days left"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee Pro · 这个账号下找不到这笔购买": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee Pro · No purchase found for this account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee Pro · 这笔购买已被撤销": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee Pro · This purchase was revoked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee 就在菜单栏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee lives in the menu bar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee 常驻菜单栏，开机自启后随时按快捷键就能截": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee lives in the menu bar; with this on, the shortcut works right after you log in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee 设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marquee 需要「屏幕录制」权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquee needs Screen Recording permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PNG（无损）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PNG (lossless)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vision 没有返回平移观测值": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vision returned no translation observation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌥ 窗口截图 · 不含阴影": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌥ Window capture · no shadow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌥ 窗口截图 · 带阴影": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌥ Window capture · with shadow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ 打码预览不可用（没拿到屏幕像素）—— 标记仍然会写进成品图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠️ Redaction preview unavailable (no screen pixels) — the marks will still be applied to the saved image"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次买断，不订阅": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-time purchase, not a subscription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不延时": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No delay"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不透明度：现在是 %lld%。点一下换下一档": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opacity: %lld%% now. Click to cycle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也可以自己滚 —— 手动模式一样能拼长图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also scroll yourself — manual mode stitches the same long image"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "了解 Pro": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learn about Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从历史里删掉（连磁盘上的文件一起清）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete from history (removes the file on disk too)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位移不是有限数值": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The offset is not a finite number"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存位置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save location"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存到磁盘并关闭（⌘S）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save to disk and close (⌘S)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存失败：%@ 里同名文件太多，剪贴板里的图仍然可用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save failed: too many files with the same name in %@. The image is still on the clipboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先框出一块区域，再点识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select a region first, then click Recognize"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "免费版只保留最近 %lld 张 · 升级到 Pro 可保留全部": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The free version keeps the last %lld captures · Upgrade to Pro to keep them all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全局生效，应用不在前台也能触发": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works globally, even when the app is in the background"
