    "取消（丢弃刚画的标注，不改剪贴板）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel (discard annotations, clipboard untouched)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在有损格式下有效": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only applies to lossy formats"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有 ⇧ 不够，会和普通输入冲突，请带上 ⌘ ⌃ 或 ⌥": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⇧ alone is not enough — it collides with normal typing. Add ⌘, ⌃ or ⌥."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有按 ⌘S 或点「保存」时才写盘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Written to disk only on ⌘S or Save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
